==Battleground==
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~23.33 seconds<sup>180f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mighty Gui Zuli]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 44~44.67 seconds<sup>1,320f~1,340f</sup>.
**Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 80~80.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,420f</sup>.
**4 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Kang Roos provide plenty of cash so you're free to spam everything you can once you hit the base. Bring a ranged attacker like Bahamut Cat to take out Mighty Gui Zuli.

